      "widgets_values": [
        "## EcoHash text to video\n\nConfigure the connection in the EcoHash sidebar before running. VIDEO → Save Video preserves the MP4 audio track.\n\nLeave job_id blank for a new generation. To resume a task after a timeout/interruption, paste its ID from Video task or the server log; keep the original connection and protocol. Interrupting ComfyUI stops local waiting, not the remote job.\n\nUses EcoHash /video/generations and /video/jobs/{id}. Choose a model that supports text-to-video. Reference-dependent models are not supported by this text-only example."
